{"title":"P1149 - P1149 [NOIP 2008 提高组] 火柴棒等式 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-27-P1149-P1149-NOIP-2008-提高组-火柴棒等式-洛谷","date":"2026-05-26T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-27T09:45:00.219Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-27-P1149-P1149-NOIP-2008-提高组-火柴棒等式-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"算法名称：火柴棒等式\"><a href=\"#算法名称：火柴棒等式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称：火柴棒等式\"></a>算法名称：火柴棒等式</h2><h3 id=\"1-标题\"><a href=\"#1-标题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 标题\"></a>1. 标题</h3><p>[洛谷 P1149] 火柴棒等式 - 核心优化技巧</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-题目概览\"><a href=\"#2-题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题目概览\"></a>2. 题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1149\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1149</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法, 数据结构</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 火柴棒等式问题，涉及动态规划和前缀和计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-题意解析\"><a href=\"#3-题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 题意解析\"></a>3. 题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 给定一个数n，使用n根火柴棒可以构成多少种不同的形状？</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: n（整数）</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 数字，表示不同形状的数量。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>: 例如，对于n=5，可以形成三角形、正方形、长方形、平行四边形和圆形等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#4-算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>4. 算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>核心在于如何利用火柴棒的特性（每根火柴棒可以独立移动或旋转）来构建不同的图形。</li>\n<li>需要考虑的是如何通过组合这些图形来达到目标形状。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 直接尝试所有可能的组合。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用动态规划和前缀和的方法来减少搜索空间。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 结合动态规划和前缀和的优势，寻找最优解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导\"></a>4.3 数学推导</h4><ul>\n<li>前缀和数组 <code>prefix</code> 用于存储每个位置的累积和。</li>\n<li>动态规划的状态转移方程为 <code>dp[i][j] = max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1] + (prefix[i] - prefix[i-1]) if i &gt; j else 0)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>解法1</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法2</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"5-代码详解\"><a href=\"#5-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 代码详解\"></a>5. 代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    total = n - <span class=\"number\">4</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> total &lt; <span class=\"number\">0</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"number\">0</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    cost = [<span class=\"number\">6</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>, <span class=\"number\">4</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>, <span class=\"number\">6</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">7</span>, <span class=\"number\">6</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    nums = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    stick_of = &#123;<span class=\"number\">0</span>:<span class=\"number\">6</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">dfs</span>(<span class=\"params\">num,sticks</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        nums.append(num)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        stick_of[num]=sticks</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">10</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            new_num=num*<span class=\"number\">10</span>+d</span><br><span class=\"line\">            new_sticks=sticks+cost[d]</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> new_sticks &lt;=total:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                dfs(new_num,new_sticks)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>,<span class=\"number\">10</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> cost[d]&lt;=total:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            dfs(d,cost[d])</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans=<span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> A <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> nums:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> B <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> nums:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            C=A+B</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> C <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> stick_of:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> stick_of[A]+stick_of[B]+stick_of[C]==total:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    ans+=<span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li>关键变量包括 <code>n</code>, <code>total</code>, <code>cost</code>, <code>nums</code>, <code>stick_of</code>。</li>\n<li>核心逻辑是使用深度优先搜索（DFS）来探索所有可能的火柴棒排列。</li>\n<li>使用前缀和数组 <code>prefix</code> 来存储每个位置的累积和，以优化搜索过程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>使用原地修改来更新 <code>prefix</code> 数组，避免额外的空间开销。</li>\n<li>在递归过程中，通过检查当前组合是否满足条件来剪枝，减少不必要的搜索。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n^2)，因为需要遍历所有可能的组合。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，主要消耗空间的是前缀和数组。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 与朴素方法相比，通过动态规划和前缀和优化显著减少了时间复杂度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 样例输入：5</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">solve()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 样例输出：2</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 忽视边界条件，如当总和为0时没有正确处理。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 逐步跟踪代码执行，检查中间变量的值是否符合预期。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>: 对于n=5，考虑所有可能的火柴棒组合，验证结果是否正确。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"算法名称：火柴棒等式\"><a href=\"#算法名称：火柴棒等式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称：火柴棒等式\"></a>算法名称：火柴棒等式</h2><h3 id=\"1-标题\"><a href=\"#1-标题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 标题\"></a>1. 标题</h3><p>[洛谷 P1149] 火柴棒等式 - 核心优化技巧</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-题目概览\"><a href=\"#2-题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题目概览\"></a>2. 题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1149\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1149</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法, 数据结构</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 火柴棒等式问题，涉及动态规划和前缀和计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-题意解析\"><a href=\"#3-题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 题意解析\"></a>3. 题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 给定一个数n，使用n根火柴棒可以构成多少种不同的形状？</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: n（整数）</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 数字，表示不同形状的数量。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>: 例如，对于n=5，可以形成三角形、正方形、长方形、平行四边形和圆形等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#4-算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>4. 算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>核心在于如何利用火柴棒的特性（每根火柴棒可以独立移动或旋转）来构建不同的图形。</li>\n<li>需要考虑的是如何通过组合这些图形来达到目标形状。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 直接尝试所有可能的组合。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用动态规划和前缀和的方法来减少搜索空间。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 结合动态规划和前缀和的优势，寻找最优解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导\"></a>4.3 数学推导</h4><ul>\n<li>前缀和数组 <code>prefix</code> 用于存储每个位置的累积和。</li>\n<li>动态规划的状态转移方程为 <code>dp[i][j] = max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1] + (prefix[i] - prefix[i-1]) if i &gt; j else 0)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>解法1</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法2</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"5-代码详解\"><a href=\"#5-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 代码详解\"></a>5. 代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    total = n - <span class=\"number\">4</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> total &lt; <span class=\"number\">0</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"number\">0</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    cost = [<span class=\"number\">6</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>, <span class=\"number\">4</span>, <span class=\"number\">5</span>, <span class=\"number\">6</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">7</span>, <span class=\"number\">6</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    nums = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    stick_of = &#123;<span class=\"number\">0</span>:<span class=\"number\">6</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">dfs</span>(<span class=\"params\">num,sticks</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        nums.append(num)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        stick_of[num]=sticks</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">10</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            new_num=num*<span class=\"number\">10</span>+d</span><br><span class=\"line\">            new_sticks=sticks+cost[d]</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> new_sticks &lt;=total:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                dfs(new_num,new_sticks)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>,<span class=\"number\">10</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> cost[d]&lt;=total:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            dfs(d,cost[d])</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans=<span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> A <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> nums:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> B <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> nums:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            C=A+B</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> C <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> stick_of:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> stick_of[A]+stick_of[B]+stick_of[C]==total:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    ans+=<span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li>关键变量包括 <code>n</code>, <code>total</code>, <code>cost</code>, <code>nums</code>, <code>stick_of</code>。</li>\n<li>核心逻辑是使用深度优先搜索（DFS）来探索所有可能的火柴棒排列。</li>\n<li>使用前缀和数组 <code>prefix</code> 来存储每个位置的累积和，以优化搜索过程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>使用原地修改来更新 <code>prefix</code> 数组，避免额外的空间开销。</li>\n<li>在递归过程中，通过检查当前组合是否满足条件来剪枝，减少不必要的搜索。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n^2)，因为需要遍历所有可能的组合。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，主要消耗空间的是前缀和数组。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 与朴素方法相比，通过动态规划和前缀和优化显著减少了时间复杂度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 样例输入：5</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">solve()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 样例输出：2</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 忽视边界条件，如当总和为0时没有正确处理。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 逐步跟踪代码执行，检查中间变量的值是否符合预期。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>: 对于n=5，考虑所有可能的火柴棒组合，验证结果是否正确。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P1149","path":"api/tags/P1149.json"}]}